      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Accessibility\n\n- Keyboard navigation across dates/events\n- Enter opens event, Escape closes modal\n- Focus restoration after dialogs\n- ARIA labels for event blocks\n- Screen reader announcements for conflicts\n- Color is not the only signal\n- High contrast and visible focus rings",
      "originalText": "Accessibility\n\n- Keyboard navigation across dates/events\n- Enter opens event, Escape closes modal\n- Focus restoration after dialogs\n- ARIA labels for event blocks\n- Screen reader announcements for conflicts\n- Color is not the only signal\n- High contrast and visible focus rings",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
