      "height": 308.75,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Tradeoffs\n\nREST vs GraphQL\n- REST is simple for range queries\n- GraphQL helps flexible multi-entity queries\n\nOptimistic vs strict confirmation\n- Optimistic for reversible UI\n- Strict for invites, permissions, series edits\n\nClient vs server recurrence\n- Server authoritative\n- Client can preview visible range",
      "originalText": "Tradeoffs\n\nREST vs GraphQL\n- REST is simple for range queries\n- GraphQL helps flexible multi-entity queries\n\nOptimistic vs strict confirmation\n- Optimistic for reversible UI\n- Strict for invites, permissions, series edits\n\nClient vs server recurrence\n- Server authoritative\n- Client can preview visible range",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 233,
      "index": "b1g",
      "autoResize": true
