      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Staff-level summary\n\nThe frontend owns user trust.\n\nA strong design treats time correctness, \ncollaboration, privacy, accessibility, \nobservability, and performance as first-class \narchitecture constraints — not afterthoughts.",
      "originalText": "Staff-level summary\n\nThe frontend owns user trust.\n\nA strong design treats time correctness, \ncollaboration, privacy, accessibility, \nobservability, and performance as first-class \narchitecture constraints — not afterthoughts.",
